1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,964
Stop trying to change everything at once. Start tiny.

2
00:00:05,314 --> 00:00:10,655
Big goals feel exciting, but they're hard to keep. Tiny habits are easy to repeat.

3
00:00:11,705 --> 00:00:14,784
One. Make it tiny. Two push-ups, not fifty.

4
00:00:15,834 --> 00:00:20,723
Two. Stack it. Do it right after something you already do, like brushing your teeth.

5
00:00:21,673 --> 00:00:25,463
Three. Track it. Check off every day, and don't break the chain.

6
00:00:26,514 --> 00:00:30,263
Four. Celebrate small wins. A quick yes keeps you going.

7
00:00:31,313 --> 00:00:34,834
What tiny habit will you start today? Tell me in the comments.

8
00:00:36,484 --> 00:00:39,246
Follow me for more health and wellness content.

